:"『知的文化学研究同好会』 に所属する同級生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼く可愛らしい外見をしているが、実はれっきとした男の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公のコトが好き好き大好き、……もちろん性別を超えた意味で。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その好意を隠そうとしてないが、犬が主人に対する好意みたいなモノだと主人公は思っており、真剣に取り合っていない。（友情？）"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々主人公のチャット仲間で、某掲示板で知り合い、主人公のコトを慕うきっかけとなったのもこの頃。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プレイベートでは常に可愛らしい女の子の格好に身を包んできたが、学園ではそれを隠して普通に男子学生として振る舞っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし主人公に対する想いが募りに募って、女子学生の制服に身を包み 『知的文化学研究同好会』 に入部する決心をした。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段の男子学生状態でも、下から目を潤ませて見つめる攻撃は多くの人を魅了し……血迷った男子学生、ショタ好き女子学生に良くも悪くも人気……らしい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ん～～、すんすん……ヒロの匂ぃ、幸せだよぉ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67152"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"148 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"253","sourceWorkId":"16947","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c24060","value":"m"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"253","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"253","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67152","value":"男"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3d/3da16195c0ab3e68352827f1bd25cf7de6992e8c26a7ed9c147a402e7a09c9c9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/09/096287b59f432f088eb923a31da78d341b6d96b6da6b20f4ed113844caeff3bc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西沢広香","creatorId":"vndb:s609","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s609","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s609","name":"西沢 広香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:42849:67152:5890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42803","characterName":"飯泉 宏人","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42803"},"originalCharacterName":"飯泉 宏人","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he is notoriously troublesome, he is THE average person with three perfect qualities: normal appearance, normal grades, and normal athletic ability. His hobbies include surfing the Internet and playing bishojo games."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he longs for a life of fulfillment, he ends up wasting his days in idleness due to his lazy and tedious nature. He and his classmate, Ami Himekawa, have had a close relationship since junior high school and is one of the few girls with whom he can casually converse."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His latest problem is whether or not to use Ami as jerk off material for the night. It is a difficult question that crosses the line."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Nanase seduced him into founding the “Intellectual and Cultural Studies Club,” and forced him to become the head of the club, which he continues to do."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although he considers himself normal, he has a strong desire for trouble, and his tastes are quite broad, making him a pervert in that area. He is not aware of it at all, perhaps because he has an extreme friend, Yoshio, nearby."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c42803"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a5/a5276aa2ff6a2c5524c4bc3f513b89adf945e8eafb98b6733e9363f2d112473c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/23/23eec558fee5696494c79a76a50d35d410fccd0d55938793021356db63ed2af5.webp","width":187,"height":136,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c42804","characterName":"やまだ・G・よしお","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c42804